# Environment
.env

# MASTER-WAVE-2 hardening (W2-SEC C-5): secret-material patterns — never
# tracked, defense-in-depth beyond the explicit .env above.
# RC1 audit remediation 2026-11-16: the placeholder-only production TEMPLATE is
# explicitly whitelisted — the previous blanket `.env.*` rule silently ignored
# it (root cause of the RC1 audit discrepancy where commit 287f349 claimed the
# template while it never entered the committed tree). Only the exact template
# name is un-ignored; every other .env.* variant stays ignored.
.env.*
!.env.production.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

